{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1403541-sanctum-limits","id":1403541,"title":"Sanctum Limits","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-07-19T10:11:10-07:00","id":1403541,"title":"Sanctum Limits","content":"Hi. <br /> <br /> I was thinking about the limitis of the Sanctum background. Lets use a hypothetical situation. <br /> <br /> Lets say Im a master in Forces and Correspondence. Lets say I have a powerful sanctum and access to a node. What prevents me from conducting a long ritual to make a building float in the middle of idk, Manhattan, with a ton of witnesses seeing it, if I do it from my sanctum - which would make my magic coincidental and, on top of that, lower the difficulty -, putting some decent amounts of quintessence to keep the difficulty, again, in standard? <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5394-argonot","name":"Argonot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5394_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"227"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-19T10:35:06-07:00","id":1403545,"title":"","content":"Question: Which edition of Mage are you looking at?<br /> <br /> Looking up the rules in M20, the talk is of things been coincidental inside the sanctum, so casting it I'd say is coincidental and gets the lower cost and difficulty benefits, however once you reaches beyond the boundaries of the Sanctum, then Paradox comes to call. Same issue the Union has with some hightech stuff that works in the Lab but not in the field.<br /> <br /> So everything in the example would be fine - the sanctum would reduce difficulty of the casting, and the quintessence would help there. However once you reach beyond the bounds of the sanctum then paradox kicks in.<br /> <br /> (NB would also probably request some Matter in the casting to effect the building)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26145-babi_gog","name":"babi_gog","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26145_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"94"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-19T14:56:17-07:00","id":1403577,"title":"","content":"In pretty much every edition, there's some variation that comes down to: casting from inside your Sanctum to outside your Sanctum counts as casting where the spell happens.<br /> <br /> Anything other interpretation makes the setting as presented illogical beyond belief.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-20T05:10:20-07:00","id":1403646,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1403541-sanctum-limits?p=1403577#post1403577\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In pretty much every edition, there's some variation that comes down to: casting from inside your Sanctum to outside your Sanctum counts as casting where the spell happens.<br /> <br /> Anything other interpretation makes the setting as presented illogical beyond belief.</div> </div> </div> </div>^This.<br /> <br /> Sanctum only gives the Mage a break on Effects happening within the bounds of that Sanctum. It's why Archmages can live for centuries, even on Earth, so long as they stick to their little corner and never leave.<br /> <br /> It's also why you can't just drop a fireball on someone with Correspondence and get no Paradox for it. (At least, not without being clever about disguising it, like with a gas main explosion or the like).<br /> <br /> If it's such an obvious exploit that could break the fundamentals of the game, it's probably not the intended use or interpretation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-20T22:32:37-07:00","id":1403764,"title":"","content":"I was talking about M20.<br /> <br /> Thank you so much for the clarification. I must have misread the background. Now it does make sense.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5394-argonot","name":"Argonot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5394_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"227"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}